<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0B1E63"><title>GAAWOW EMS | Attendance</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f5f7fa;color:#172033;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}.top{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0B1E63,#0B4DA2);color:#fff;padding:22px}.gold{color:#D4AF37}main{max-width:900px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 16px}.card{background:white;border-radius:14px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:0 5px 18px #0000000a}a{display:inline-block;background:#0B1E63;color:white;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}.note{background:#fff7dc;border-left:4px solid #D4AF37;padding:13px;border-radius:8px;line-height:1.6}li{margin:8px 0}</style></head><body><header class="top"><b>GAAWOW EMS</b><div class="gold">Attendance Management</div></header><main><section class="card"><h1>Attendance Management</h1><p>Official attendance module entry page for GAAWOW EMS.</p><div class="note"><b>Setup status:</b> This is a safe module landing page. Attendance recording has not been connected in this package because the live attendance table columns and current RLS policies must be checked first. This prevents incorrect writes or weakening database security.</div><h2>Supported attendance statuses</h2><ul><li>Present</li><li>Absent</li><li>Late</li><li>Excused</li></ul><p>Before enabling record/edit actions, verify the existing attendance schema, class/lesson relationships, institution scope, and teacher permissions in Supabase.</p><a href="dashboard.html">Back to Dashboard</a></section></main></body></html>